Notebook[
 {
  Cell[
   "Kalman Filtering vs. ARMA Models for Stock Trend Extraction and Future Price Prediction",
   "Title"
  ],
  Cell[
   "A Rigorous Comparative Framework in Wolfram Language: Trend Derivation, Out-of-Sample Forecasting, and Rolling Walk-Forward Backtesting. ",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "1. Executive Summary and Theoretical Framework",
   "Section"
  ],
  Cell[
   "Predicting future stock prices and extracting dynamic trends are two foundational problems in quantitative finance. Two distinct mathematical paradigms are commonly employed:",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "1. Autoregressive Moving Average (ARMA) Models: Rooted in classical econometric time series analysis (Box-Jenkins methodology), ARMA models capture stationary autocorrelation structures in returns and project them forward toward the unconditional long-term drift rate.",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "2. Kalman Filtering and State-Space Models: Rooted in control theory and Bayesian dynamic linear models, Kalman filters estimate unobserved hidden states (the true trend level and instantaneous momentum/drift) from noisy sequential observations, updating estimates recursively with optimal Bayesian variance reduction. ",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell["Research Objective", "Subsection"],
  Cell[
   "How accurately can ARMA models and Kalman Filter trend models predict the expected future price of a stock (specifically, the expected average price over an investment horizon, such as a 20-day trading month)? ",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell["Mathematical Specification", "Subsection"],
  Cell[
   "(A) The ARMA Process on Stock Returns",
   "Subsubsection"
  ],
  Cell[
   "Stock price levels P_t are non-stationary I(1) processes. Direct ARMA estimation on raw prices often fails or yields explosive roots (|phi| >= 1). We therefore model stationary continuously compounded log returns:",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  r",
     StyleBox["t = ln(P", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t / P",
     StyleBox["{t-1}) = ln(P", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t) - ln(P_{t-1})"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "An ARMA(p, q) process for returns is defined as:",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  r",
     StyleBox["t = c + Sum[phi", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "i  r",
     StyleBox["{t-i}, {i, 1, p}] + eps", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t + Sum[theta_j  eps_{t-j}, {j, 1, q}]"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "Given multi-step forecasted returns {r",
     StyleBox["{T+1}, ..., r", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "{T+H}}, the reconstructed future price trajectory is:"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  P",
     StyleBox["{T+h} = P", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "T * Exp[Accumulate[{r",
     StyleBox["{T+1}, ..., r", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "{T+h}}]]"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "The expected average future price over horizon H is:",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  P",
     StyleBox["avg", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "ARMA = (1/H) * Sum[P_{T+h}, {h, 1, H}] "
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "(B) The Local Linear Trend (LLT) Kalman Filter",
   "Subsubsection"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "The state-space model decomposes price y",
     StyleBox["t = P", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t into an unobserved dynamic level mu",
     StyleBox["t and velocity/slope beta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t:"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  Observation Equation:  y",
     StyleBox["t = mu", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t + eps",
     StyleBox["t,        eps", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t ~ N(0, sigma_eps^2)"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  Level Transition:      mu",
     StyleBox["{t+1} = mu", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t + beta",
     StyleBox["t + eta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "mu",
     StyleBox["t,  eta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "mu",
     StyleBox["t ~ N(0, sigma", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "mu^2)"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  Slope Transition:      beta",
     StyleBox["{t+1} = beta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t + eta",
     StyleBox["beta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t,     eta",
     StyleBox["beta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "t ~ N(0, sigma_beta^2)"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "Forward extrapolation h steps ahead from terminal state (mu",
     StyleBox["T, beta", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "T):"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  P",
     StyleBox["{Kalman, T+h} = mu", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "T + h * beta_T"
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   "The expected average future price over horizon H is analytically:",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   TextData[
    {
     "  P",
     StyleBox["avg", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "Kalman = (1/H) ",
     StyleBox[" Sum[mu_T + h ", FontSlant -> Italic],
     " beta",
     StyleBox["T, {h, 1, H}] = mu", FontSlant -> Italic],
     "T + ((H + 1) / 2) * beta_T "
    }
   ],
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   BoxData[
    TagBox[
     GridBox[
      {
       {TemplateBox[{0}, "Spacer1"]},
       {TemplateBox[{0}, "Spacer1"]}
      },
      AutoDelete -> False,
      FrameStyle ->
       Directive[
        LightDarkSwitched[GrayLevel[0.8], GrayLevel[0.48678]],
        AbsoluteThickness[1]
       ],
      GridBoxDividers -> {
       "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False},
       "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}
      },
      GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}
     ],
     "Grid"
    ]
   ],
   "Text",
   "MarkdownDelimiter",
   ShowStringCharacters -> False,
   Background -> None
  ],
  Cell[
   "2. Stock Data Acquisition and Preprocessing",
   "Section"
  ],
  Cell[
   "We acquire daily historical data for the S&P 500 ETF (SPY) using Wolfram Language's built-in FinancialData. We convert Quantity expressions to pure numeric values and compute continuously compounded log returns. ",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   BoxData[
    RowBox[
     {
      RowBox[
       {
        "(*",
        " ",
        RowBox[
         {
          "Define",
          " ",
          "stock",
          " ",
          "ticker",
          " ",
          "and",
          " ",
          "evaluation",
          " ",
          "date",
          " ",
          "range"
         }
        ],
        " ",
        "*)"
       }
      ],
      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
      RowBox[
       {
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"ticker", "=", "\"SPY\""}], ";"}],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "startDate",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"2023", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "endDate",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"2024", ",", "12", ",", "31"}], "}"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "Print",
            "[",
            RowBox[
             {
              "\"Fetching historical daily data for \"",
              ",",
              "ticker",
              ",",
              "\"...\""
             }
            ],
            "]"
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "rawTS",
            "=",
            RowBox[
             {
              "FinancialData",
              "[",
              RowBox[
               {
                "ticker",
                ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"startDate", ",", "endDate"}], "}"}]
               }
              ],
              "]"
             }
            ]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          "(*",
          " ",
          RowBox[
           {
            "Extract",
            " ",
            "pure",
            " ",
            "numeric",
            " ",
            "prices",
            " ",
            "and",
            " ",
            "trading",
            " ",
            "dates"
           }
          ],
          " ",
          "*)"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "pricesTS",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"QuantityMagnitude", "[", "rawTS", "]"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "tradingDates",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"pricesTS", "[", "\"Dates\"", "]"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "rawPrices",
            "=",
            RowBox[
             {
              "Normal",
              "[",
              RowBox[{"pricesTS", "[", "\"Values\"", "]"}],
              "]"
             }
            ]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {"nTotal", "=", RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rawPrices", "]"}]}
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "Print",
            "[",
            RowBox[
             {
              "\"Successfully loaded \"",
              ",",
              "nTotal",
              ",",
              "\" trading days from \"",
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "DateString",
                "[",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[{"First", "[", "tradingDates", "]"}],
                  ",",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "{",
                    RowBox[{"\"MonthName\"", ",", "\" \"", ",", "\"Year\""}],
                    "}"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                "]"
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\" to \"",
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "DateString",
                "[",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[{"Last", "[", "tradingDates", "]"}],
                  ",",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "{",
                    RowBox[{"\"MonthName\"", ",", "\" \"", ",", "\"Year\""}],
                    "}"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                "]"
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\".\""
             }
            ],
            "]"
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   ],
   "Input"
  ],
  Cell[
   "Next, we compute log returns and visualize the historical price trajectory alongside the daily return series. ",
   "Text"
  ],
  Cell[
   BoxData[
    RowBox[
     {
      RowBox[
       {
        "(*",
        " ",
        RowBox[{"Compute", " ", "log", " ", "returns"}],
        " ",
        "*)"
       }
      ],
      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
      RowBox[
       {
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {"logPrices", "=", RowBox[{"Log", "[", "rawPrices", "]"}]}
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "logReturns",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"Differences", "[", "logPrices", "]"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          "(*",
          " ",
          RowBox[
           {
            "Plot",
            " ",
            "historical",
            " ",
            "prices",
            " ",
            "and",
            " ",
            "daily",
            " ",
            "returns"
           }
          ],
          " ",
          "*)"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "pPrice",
            "=",
            RowBox[
             {
              "DateListPlot",
              "[",
              RowBox[
               {
                "pricesTS",
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "PlotStyle",
                  "->",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "Directive",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "Thick",
                      ",",
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        "RGBColor",
                        "[",
                        RowBox[{"0.1", ",", "0.4", ",", "0.7"}],
                        "]"
                       }
                      ]
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "PlotLabel",
                  "->",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "Style",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        "ticker",
                        " ",
                        "<>",
                        " ",
                        "\" Daily Adjusted Close Price (2023 - 2024)\""
                       }
                      ],
                      ",",
                      "Bold",
                      ",",
                      "14"
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "FrameLabel",
                  "->",
                  RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"None", ",", "\"Price ($)\""}], "}"}]
                 }
                ],
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[{"GridLines", "->", "Automatic"}],
                ",",
                RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "550"}]
               }
              ],
              "]"
             }
            ]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "pRet",
            "=",
            RowBox[
             {
              "ListLinePlot",
              "[",
              RowBox[
               {
                "logReturns",
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "PlotStyle",
                  "->",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "Directive",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "RGBColor",
                      "[",
                      RowBox[{"0.8", ",", "0.3", ",", "0.2"}],
                      "]"
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "PlotLabel",
                  "->",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "Style",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[
                       {"ticker", " ", "<>", " ", "\" Daily Log Returns\""}
                      ],
                      ",",
                      "Bold",
                      ",",
                      "14"
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "AxesLabel",
                  "->",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "{",
                    RowBox[{"\"Trading Day\"", ",", "\"Log Return\""}],
                    "}"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ",",
                "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                "  ",
                RowBox[{"GridLines", "->", "Automatic"}],
                ",",
                RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "550"}]
               }
              ],
              "]"
             }
            ]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          "GraphicsColumn",
          "[",
          RowBox[
           {
            RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"pPrice", ",", "pRet"}], "}"}],
            ",",
            RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "550"}]
           }
          ],
          "]"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   ],
   "Input"
  ],
  Cell[
   "We now compute key summary statistics for the daily returns: ",
   "CodeText"
  ],
  Cell[
   BoxData[
    RowBox[
     {
      RowBox[
       {
        "(*",
        " ",
        RowBox[
         {
          "Summary",
          " ",
          "statistics",
          " ",
          "for",
          " ",
          "log",
          " ",
          "returns"
         }
        ],
        " ",
        "*)"
       }
      ],
      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
      RowBox[
       {
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {"retMean", "=", RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "logReturns", "]"}]}
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "retStd",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "logReturns", "]"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "retSkew",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"Skewness", "[", "logReturns", "]"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          RowBox[
           {
            "retKurt",
            "=",
            RowBox[{"Kurtosis", "[", "logReturns", "]"}]
           }
          ],
          ";"
         }
        ],
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
        RowBox[
         {
          "Dataset",
          "[",
          RowBox[
           {
            "<|",
            "\[IndentingNewLine]",
            "  ",
            RowBox[
             {
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Sample Size (Days)\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "logReturns", "]"}]
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Daily Mean Return\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "NumberForm",
                  "[",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "retMean",
                    ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"6", ",", "5"}], "}"}]
                   }
                  ],
                  "]"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Annualized Return (x252)\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "NumberForm",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[{"retMean", "*", "252", "*", "100"}],
                      ",",
                      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"4", ",", "2"}], "}"}]
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ],
                  " ",
                  "<>",
                  " ",
                  "\"%\""
                 }
                ]
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Daily Volatility\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "NumberForm",
                  "[",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "retStd",
                    ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"6", ",", "5"}], "}"}]
                   }
                  ],
                  "]"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Annualized Volatility (xSqrt[252])\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "NumberForm",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        "retStd",
                        "*",
                        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "252", "]"}],
                        "*",
                        "100"
                       }
                      ],
                      ",",
                      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"4", ",", "2"}], "}"}]
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ],
                  " ",
                  "<>",
                  " ",
                  "\"%\""
                 }
                ]
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Skewness\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "NumberForm",
                  "[",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "retSkew",
                    ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"4", ",", "2"}], "}"}]
                   }
                  ],
                  "]"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ],
              ",",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "  ",
              RowBox[
               {
                "\"Kurtosis\"",
                "->",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "NumberForm",
                  "[",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "retKurt",
                    ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"4", ",", "2"}], "}"}]
                   }
                  ],
                  "]"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ],
            "\[IndentingNewLine]",
            "|>"
           }
          ],
          "]"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   ],
   "Input"
  ],
  Cell[
   BoxData[
    TagBox[
     GridBox[
      {
       {TemplateBox[{0}, "Spacer1"]},
